b.constraint('requirement_identity_preservation',['requirement_declaration'],'Preserve stable ids, aliases, source refs/digests, relation/span/context/evidence-policy/projection references. Traversal spans reference existing callable/vector identity, not new topology, start family or vector rival. Existing frame, zoom, foldback and alias refs may be inert lineage over that identity, never rival topology/vector/frame/zoom/foldback/continuation/re-entry carriers.',[(0,23,27),(0,55,55)])
